      "error_message": "Running LUA method 'mouseEvent'. GuiElement.lua:1198: stack overflow — crash when WMStepDialog fill type list is hovered",
      "file": "src/gui/WMStepDialog.lua",
      "root_cause": "onFillTypeListSelectionChanged called fillTypeList:reloadData() without the isFiltering guard. FS25 SmoothList fires onSelectionChanged during mouseEvent processing; reloadData() triggered another onSelectionChanged → reloadData() → infinite recursion → stack overflow.",
